  "query_preview": "..\n(Sunday through next Friday)\nIssued at 1039 PM CDT Thu Aug 13 2026\n\nThe heat will continue on Sunday and Monday as the ridge holds. The \nupper ridge will get squeezed southward on Monday as an upper \ntrough traverses the southern part of the Canadian provinces. A \nweak surface front will push into our area Monday afternoon into \nTuesday. This will do two things: 1) Increase rain and storm \nchances (20-30%) 2) Temporarily knock temperatures back closer to \nnormal for Tuesday. Unfortunately, the relief looks lackluster and\ntemporary. Temperatures will again warm for the middle of next \nweek.",
